WEBVTT

00:23:29.529 --> 00:23:32.991
for those who are listening
to this conversation?

00:23:33.366 --> 00:23:37.328
VN: Yeah, I would first of all, say
that many times, you know,

00:23:37.370 --> 00:23:40.290
the climate crisis seems very complex.

00:23:40.331 --> 00:23:42.709
And many people want to do something,

00:23:42.750 --> 00:23:45.545
but they don't know exactly
what they can do.

00:23:45.879 --> 00:23:48.298
But there are so many things
that can be done.

00:23:48.298 --> 00:23:53.219
And you know, we all won't do everything.

00:23:53.261 --> 00:23:57.056
But it's finding that thing
that will transform something.

00:23:57.474 --> 00:23:59.809
You know, no one is too small
to make a difference

00:23:59.851 --> 00:24:02.270
and no action is too small
to transform the world.